{"data": [{"article": {"title": "Grok Bot From Beginner to Pro: How I Run My Businesses From My 𝕏 DMs"}, "author_id": "1729879736183324672", "created_at": "2026-10-27T11:45:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115047159997538421"], "id": "2115047159997538421", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 275, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I tried almost every AI agent this year.\n\nMy $600 Mac Mini running OpenClaw sits turned off, and I shut down Hermes because it broke every morning.\n\nNow I moved my entire business to Grok Bot.\n\nHere is my full Beginner-to-Pro playbook: https://t.co/8IBGvELWZR", "url": "https://x.com/JordanRafealov/status/2115047159997538421"}, {"article": {"title": "Anthropic Filed for an IPO. What It Means for Marketers"}, "author_id": "2069660450929913856", "created_at": "2026-10-27T09:13:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115008872486424902"], "id": "2115008872486424902", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 318, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just filed to go public.\n\nSkip the valuation talk. The filing shows how businesses really use Claude, and what's coming for marketing teams 👇\n\n#Anthropic #AI https://t.co/HPR2l4OnzY", "url": "https://x.com/umerdarazkha/status/2115008872486424902"}, {"article": {"title": "徹底比較「Grok Bot」「Muse」活用事例10選"}, "author_id": "2067533424693579776", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:29:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114998024296357987"], "id": "2114998024296357987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2513, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Rc88S74hu8", "url": "https://x.com/node_ai_dev/status/2114998024296357987"}, {"article": {"title": "OpenBot Can Run Codex, Claude and Grok Together. But Would You Trust It With Your Computer?"}, "author_id": "1453615749205876739", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:29:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114997895812583717"], "id": "2114997895812583717", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 248, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenBot can run Codex, Claude and Grok together.\n\nThen I read its README: `danger-full-access` and `approvalPolicy: never`.\n\nThe capabilities are real. So are the tradeoffs.\n\nWould you trust it with your computer? https://t.co/7l1vQVzMvx", "url": "https://x.com/AnthonyWidodo_/status/2114997895812583717"}, {"article": {"title": "Aeon vs Claude Duet: the agent that asks and the one that runs"}, "author_id": "1826623713216692224", "created_at": "2026-10-27T07:12:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114978495616954727"], "id": "2114978495616954727", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1020, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/3xI3OaKL7Z", "url": "https://x.com/aeonframework/status/2114978495616954727"}, {"author_id": "58092553", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:57:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114974815534936221"], "id": "2114974815534936221", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114797551685615862", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI Haven't tried Meta Muse. Can you give some feedback on it?", "url": "https://x.com/hughnguyen_vn/status/2114974815534936221"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:31:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114953136620109913"], "id": "2114953136620109913", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tip for sharing a Meta Muse invite code: paste it as plain text instead of a screenshot. People can copy it in one tap, and fewer typos means fewer failed tries.\n\nI built MuseKu, a free place to post it: https://t.co/t3hU5b9Qob #Muse", "url": "https://x.com/zhaojianming40/status/2114953136620109913"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114948978471063552"]}, "author_id": "2039273992507277313", "created_at": "2026-10-27T05:15:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114948980652093682"], "id": "2114948980652093682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 120, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse or Grok Bot?\n\nWhich one would you actually trust in your daily workflow? https://t.co/I9DXc1xXiL", "url": "https://x.com/ItsKamranK/status/2114948980652093682"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114873194297368576"]}, "author_id": "2079234141086760960", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:14:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114873245941792825", "2114873318205509786"], "id": "2114873318205509786", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Holy sh*t... 4 AI models got the same prompt: build a holographic CD you can tilt and shatter.\n\nGPT-6 Astra. Meta Muse Wonder. Claude Opus 5.5. Claude Fable 5.1.\n\nFrom the front, all 4 look the same.\n\nHot-pink disc. “Pixel Dreams” label. Clouds, stars, a ringed planet.\n\nThe front https://t.co/CoR0An0mjI", "url": "https://x.com/KlyroOG/status/2114873318205509786"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114873194297368576"]}, "author_id": "2079234141086760960", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:14:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114873245941792825", "2114873318205509786"], "id": "2114873245941792825", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Holy shit... 4 AI models got the same prompt: build a holographic CD you can tilt and shatter.\n\nGPT-6 Astra. Meta Muse Wonder. Claude Opus 5.5. Claude Fable 5.1.\n\nFrom the front, all 4 look the same.\n\nHot-pink disc. “Pixel Dreams” label. Clouds, stars, a ringed planet.\n\nThe front https://t.co/87sBp318zQ", "url": "https://x.com/KlyroOG/status/2114873245941792825"}, {"author_id": "1786846062390431744", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:51:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114822163924664420"], "id": "2114822163924664420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2408, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Serious question for people who using Meta Muse for work, can you share what you do with it? All my replies saying I’m not fair to Muse but in my tests results are very mid. Way worse than Grok bot or Duet. You tried other agents and chose Muse, why? What’s it good at?", "url": "https://x.com/mrfundman/status/2114822163924664420"}, {"author_id": "1955708507942215680", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:20:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114814412573868532"], "id": "2114814412573868532", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1762435649976856576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114055789161959837", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@itsankitakar Meta Muse, but I have not tried Caude Duet.", "url": "https://x.com/ourhomeswtbama/status/2114814412573868532"}, {"author_id": "1972378540344795137", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:12:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797329681449133"], "id": "2114797329681449133", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "I Tried Meta Muse AI Video Generation: Here’s What Happened\nhttps://t.co/OggDg1jAIv", "url": "https://x.com/Skrs8xi1/status/2114797329681449133"}, {"article": {"title": "Four Bots Walk Into a Data Center: Claude vs Grok vs Muse vs ChatGPT"}, "author_id": "1885038140429127680", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:07:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114796000154194430"], "id": "2114796000154194430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 665, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic's IPO filing says it will pay SpaceX up to $120.5B for compute. Claude is literally paying Grok's rent 🚀\nI compared Claude, Grok, Muse and ChatGPT on users, money, compute and risk, and explained why I think Grok wins. NFA 🤖 https://t.co/l31WUJStkO", "url": "https://x.com/Maximilius31/status/2114796000154194430"}, {"author_id": "69974864", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:02:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114794832661303448"], "id": "2114794832661303448", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1067927682023915521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114772700639961089", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@sweatystartup Have you tried Meta Muse? Seems like a great assistant and cheaper than Grokbot", "url": "https://x.com/daniel__snyder/status/2114794832661303448"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114790776102133760"]}, "author_id": "446531731", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:46:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114790785308926243"], "id": "2114790785308926243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11100, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nike $NKE should bring Meta's $META Muse AI to Nike Vision. Oakley already has Meta glasses built for athletes. Nike, the biggest name in sport, has no AI wearable. Live pace, form coaching, and Nike Run Club in your lenses. Would you buy Nike AI glasses? https://t.co/Z4mBXl175w", "url": "https://x.com/daswani87/status/2114790785308926243"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114786206643097601"]}, "author_id": "1847772186997911552", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:28:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114786248422564067"], "id": "2114786248422564067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 253, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Meta spend $10,000,000 + on SEO for \"Superintelligence\" keyword. We spent $100 and rank #1 for keyword Private SuperIntelligence on SEO and Answer Engine Optimization!\n\nHere's the exact Playbook we used to achieve this using AI agents that work autonomously 24/7 to achieve this https://t.co/llStHqI4SV", "url": "https://x.com/prakshaljain_/status/2114786248422564067"}, {"author_id": "806400881889517568", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114781857929888121"], "id": "2114781857929888121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 201, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "3 major AI agent infrastructure drops from the last 10 days that solve the 3 biggest headaches in production:\n\n1. Agent Sandboxing -&gt;  Perplexity SPACE (Open-Source, Apache 2.0):\n\nPerplexity open-sourced its internal AI agent sandbox (SPACE), giving you an isolated environment to", "url": "https://x.com/Prayag12B/status/2114781857929888121"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2114948978471063552", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVnO4_PX0AAYr_c.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2114873194297368576", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2114873194297368576/img/tEE9KOMJZuHPBeKT.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2114790776102133760", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVk_AZfXIAA0Z4_.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2114786206643097601", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVk62a7bkAEi4UP.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1729879736183324672", "name": "Jordan Rafealov", "username": "JordanRafealov"}, {"id": "2069660450929913856", "name": "Umer Daraz Khan", "username": "umerdarazkha"}, {"id": "2067533424693579776", "name": "ばんしょう｜フルスタックエンジニア×AI", "username": "node_ai_dev"}, {"id": "1453615749205876739", "name": "Anthony", "username": "AnthonyWidodo_"}, {"id": "1826623713216692224", "name": "aeon ⭐", "username": "aeonframework"}, {"id": "58092553", "name": "Hugh Nguyen", "username": "hughnguyen_vn"}, {"id": "1614111274396418049", "name": "赵建明", "username": "zhaojianming40"}, {"id": "2039273992507277313", "name": "Kamran Khan", "username": "ItsKamranK"}, {"id": "2079234141086760960", "name": "Klyro", "username": "KlyroOG"}, {"id": "1786846062390431744", "name": "mr fundman", "username": "mrfundman"}, {"id": "1955708507942215680", "name": "Home Sweet Alabama", "username": "ourhomeswtbama"}, {"id": "1972378540344795137", "name": "Skrs", "username": "Skrs8xi1"}, {"id": "1885038140429127680", "name": "Max ⚡️+🚀=🫶", "username": "Maximilius31"}, {"id": "69974864", "name": "Daniel Snyder", "username": "daniel__snyder"}, {"id": "446531731", "name": "Anand Daswani", "username": "daswani87"}, {"id": "1847772186997911552", "name": "Prakshal Jain", "username": "prakshaljain_"}, {"id": "806400881889517568", "name": "Prayag B", "username": "Prayag12B"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115047159997538421", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlx937f5u652fj1fse2k8q91qxdp", "oldest_id": "2114781857929888121", "result_count": 18}}